<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n48594" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">torrĭdus</span></b> , a, um,
			adj.
		torreo, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>dry</i>, <i>dried up</i>, <i>parched</i>, <i>torrid.</i>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<b>Lit.</b>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">tellus,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Lucr.
					5, 1220</span></i>
			; <i><span class="en">Sil. 12, 372</span></i>; cf.: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">campi siccitate,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Liv. 22, 43, 10</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">sal,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Col.
					7, 5, 8</span></i>
			; <i><span class="en">7, 8, 4</span></i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">farra,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Ov. F.
					2, 24</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">fontes rivique,</span>”
				<i>dried up</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">Liv.
					4, 30, 7</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">aër,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Prop.
					2, 28, 3</span></i>
			; cf. 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">aestas,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Verg.
					E. 7, 48</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">zona ab igni,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id. G.
					1, 234</span></i>
			: homo vegrandi macie torridus, <i>dried</i> or
				<i>shrivelled up</i>, * <i><span class="en">Cic. Agr.
				2, 34, 93</span></i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">color sole,</span>”
				<i>embrowned</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">Plin.
					12, 20, 43, § 98</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">vox,</span>”
				<i>dry</i>, <i>hoarse</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">Calp.
					Ecl. 3, 59</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">ora,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Luc.
					4, 239</span></i>
			.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<b>Transf.</b>, of cold (cf. torreo, II.): 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">pecora jumentaque torrida frigore,</span>”
				<i>pinched</i>, <i>nipped</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">Liv.
					21, 32, 7</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">membra torrida gelu,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id.
					21, 40, 9</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">hiems,</span>”
				<i>biting</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">Calp.
					Ecl. 5, 107</span></i>
			.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
